MASTER PROJECT PROMPT: AutoInsight

AI-Powered Automated Data Cleaning, Dashboard Generation, and Verifiable Data Analysis Platform

1. Project Overview

Build a complete, professional, full-stack web application named AutoInsight (one word).

AutoInsight is an AI-powered data analytics platform that allows users, especially non-technical users, to upload raw datasets, automatically clean and validate them, generate interactive dashboards, ask questions in natural language, and receive evidence-backed answers based on their actual data.

The goal is to make data analysis accessible to anyone without requiring knowledge of Python, SQL, statistics, or data visualization.

The application must be a real, functional software product, not merely a static UI prototype. All major buttons, forms, charts, database operations, authentication flows, and analysis workflows must work.

Build the complete application in six integrated phases:

1. Website foundation and dataset upload.
2. Automated data cleaning and validation.
3. Automatic interactive dashboard generation.
4. LLM-powered data analyst.
5. Evidence-backed answer verification.
6. Complete integration, monitoring, testing, and deployment readiness.

Do not omit any of these phases.

